WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:34.330
<i>Welcome to America!</i>

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:43.110
Today's party will be the last occasion for the warriors from all around the world to relax before the tournament,

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:45.440
So everybody, please enjoy yourself!

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:50.200
And for today's special event, a <i>big</i> charity match has been organized!

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:54.690
Charity is a great thing!
I definitely want to take part in it.

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:58.330
Hey!

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:04.640
The President vs The World Selection!

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:09.570
Now, the charity match will pit three players selected among the members of the tournament,

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:12.900
against a dream team lead
by the president himself!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.650
You mean, the President of the United States?

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.650
Of course, the one and only.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:20.400
He was able to take some
time off just to be here.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:24.890
Well, then, I'll introduce
the members of the dream team.

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:26.920
First, the Hollywood star,

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:29.440
Kathy Gloria!

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:40.350
The other one, the heavy-weight boxing champion,

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:42.820
Typhoon Lewis!

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:47.230
<i>That </i>Lewis is here?!

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:52.530
While we wait for the president, we'll choose the members of the other team.

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.650
The participants should gather here.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.830
I have no interest in such festivals.

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:05.610
The officials have invited us to participate, but...

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.050
Me, me, me!

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:08.940
I'm entering! I wanna enter!

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:13.380
I'm a huge fan of Lewis! Being able to fight him would be like a dream come true!

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.520
That's fine by me.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.280
Since Kai refuses to participate...

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.730
Wait, please! I want to participate, too!

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:26.560
Rei, don't tell me...
Are you a fan of Lewis too?

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:29.840
Y-Yeah, I am...

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:37.900
Here we go...

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.370
This is... Kathy Gloria..?

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:49.060
Oh, well. Here, take it.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.290
Takao..?

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:10.800
Here I go..!

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.270
Rock, Paper...

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.080
Scissor, right?

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:19.290
I want to battle with the president!

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:22.520
Then Max will take Kai's place, okay?

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:36.170
I heard that one of the selection's members will be chosen from the PPB team...

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:38.470
That's me, right?

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.630
You're early. I thought you
would be arriving tomorrow.

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:45.600
How could I <i>not</i> participate in such a fun event?

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:49.250
I'm sorry, but the one to enter
the selection will be Emily.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:52.600
Are you kidding me?
I want to enter!

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:57.580
Micheal, you love this kind
of flashy stage, don't you?

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:01.050
The bigger the stage, the more fired up I get.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:04.520
When all eyes are on me,
that's the best feeling in the world.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.710
<i>That's</i> why we can't let you enter.

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.150
Emily, what's that supposed to mean?!

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:12.790
We can't expose our secrets
at an exhibition match like this.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.040
I know that, of course!

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:20.650
But when you're up on that stage,
you'd go all out to show off,

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.000
wouldn't you?

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:24.960
Tsk!

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:28.090
On the other hand, I can stay calm and collected.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.970
I think the choice is obvious.

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:34.650
So the three of us should enjoy this event as bystanders instead.

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:35.850
That's right.

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:39.870
Micheal, let's go.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.920
Eat something and chill out.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.820
That's right, cheer up.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.020
Yeah, okay, okay.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:51.750
Micheal, we will need your full potential at tomorrow's preliminaries.

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:04.330
Oh! It seems the president has arrived just now!

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:07.320
The charity match is about to begin!

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:11.920
Say, Max... Can't you at least
get me Lewis' autograph?

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:14.980
Hey, Takao! Stop your deplorable conduct!

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:21.360
Is this the kind of thing to say to a friend who's about to face off against the the country's most powerful person?!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.970
Oh come on, there's no need to put it like tha—

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:25.330
Yes, there is!

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:27.520
For example,

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:31.120
this is like a samurai crossing
swords with the shogun!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.790
This gets my blood boiling!

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:40.370
It's sure boiling!

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:45.790
The charity match is finally about to start!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:48.340
First, here are the members of the selection team.

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:56.100
From the BBA team, who after many fierce battles won the Chinese tournament, it's Max Mizuhara!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.440
<i>Yahoo!</i>

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:05.280
From the Brazilian team, who won the South American tournament with their energy, it's Mario De Silva!

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:18.920
From the PPB team, that with their flawless strength won the national American tournament, it's Emily Watson!

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:27.700
And to face off against them, the super star team brought together just for the occasion!

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:33.730
Let me introduce them again, Kathy Gloria and Typhoon Lewis!

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:39.100
And here's the president, who has just arrived at site!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:57.190
Ladies and gentlemen, thank you
for inviting me to this event.

00:07:57.190 --> 00:08:00.320
I will participate today
as a Beyblader just like you.

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:04.080
And of course, we will be
fighting with the intent to win.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.360
<i>Wow!</i>

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:09.710
I would like to propose a certain condition to our battle, though.

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:15.520
The tournament HQ has sent us the special rules for this match.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:21.180
Oh? This will be a team fight
composed of three rounds.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:27.100
The six players will shoot at the same time, and the team with the most Beyblades standing will win.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:35.120
This is the condition we propose. If you accept, we think we'll be able to put up a fair fight against you.

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:37.820
Okay! Let's do this, Mr. President!

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:39.830
Hey, don't decide on your own.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:43.560
Oh? You don't think you can win in a team battle?

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.840
A country's leader is trying to provocate me?

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.920
On this battlefield, I'm a Beyblader just like you guys.

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:02.320
Will the selection team accept
the president's challenge?

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.770
Very well. Let's do this.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:13.650
Okay, the charity match will be a team battle.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:17.420
Then, let's introduce the
stadium built for this occasion!

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.880
Reveal the stadium!

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:25.330
Oh! This is..!

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:41.960
It's the White House Stadium!

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:55.080
The stage of this battle will be the White House!

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:58.240
A fight with the president at the president's house!

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:01.210
Not bad, Mr. President... Not bad at all.

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:02.940
What is?

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:07.290
It's obvious that the stadium
was prepared by the president.

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:12.160
I see. The president is trying to get the higher ground.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.680
What's this higher ground? Like, the mountains?

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:18.790
Of course not! The higher ground refers to having an advantageous battlefield.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:22.120
Do you know what's in my house's garden?

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:24.990
How could I know? I've never been there.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:27.760
That's it.

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:31.900
But still, we've always fought
in unknown stadiums until now.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.930
We won't lose, no matter the stadium!

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:37.460
Max! Don't lose! You gotta win this!

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:38.910
<i>Okay!</i>

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.870
Guys, let's work hard together!

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:44.460
There's no need for <i>me</i> to work together with<i> you.</i>

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:45.910
Why is that..?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:52.450
If our level was similar, it would be different. But working together with the likes of you would be pointless.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.370
It might very well bring us down.

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:55.740
Come on!

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:57.880
She sure speaks her mind.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:03.630
In any case, I think the difference between you and I was clearly proved the other day.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:15.720
Just try not to get in my way.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:20.380
Wow, what a harsh girl.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.210
Mama...

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:30.920
Come on, let's start.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:32.430
Yeah...

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.840
Hurry up, will you? You're so slow!

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.980
Both teams, are you ready?

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:39.940
Let's go!

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:42.900
Three, Two, One...

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:45.480
Go... Shoot!

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:50.430
I'm going in for the kill!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.060
You..!

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:03.690
They're mine!

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:12.390
Wow!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:17.870
Incredible Emily! Making no distinction between enemies and allies, grabs the first victory!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.690
I knew she would do that.

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:22.970
When victory is the sole
objective, her choice is correct.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:23.930
Yeah, pretty much.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.890
Hey! How could you do that?!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:30.590
I <i>did</i> ask you not to get in my way.

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:33.100
Also, we won, so you
have no right to complain.

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:37.120
That's not right, Emily.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.920
Winning is not everything.

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:44.280
Oh, Max... You're weaker than me, yet you insist on ordering me around?

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.200
That's not what I was doing!

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:50.360
I am not going to listen to the words of someone who's weaker than me.

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:59.000
What's with her fighting style?! She's awful!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:03.960
I agree. Hurting your allies for the sake of victory goes against the way of the warrior.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:07.480
Three against one and she was still able to win..!

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:12.240
Will the world selection team keep winning like this?

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:13.880
Time for the second battle!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:15.090
<i>Oh yeah.</i>

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:16.010
Three, Two, One!
<i>Oh yeah.</i>

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:18.270
Three, Two, One!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:20.440
Go... Shoot!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:24.610
This game has already dragged on long enough!

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.370
I'll end it right now!

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:31.640
Oh, so scary.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:34.400
Losing twice in a row would be quite a problem.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:43.170
If you keep running like that you will never win, Your excellency.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.960
How long do you intend to run around for?

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:59.140
Of course..! Where did they disappear to?!

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:00.360
Now!

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.600
This is the secret move we came up with.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.420
The Revolving Attack.

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:33.970
Mario is the last man standing
for the world selection team!

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:39.280
To heck with it! I'm not gonna lose!

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:55.000
The presidential team returns
the blow with great technique!

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.620
Oh, we did it!

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:01.310
The president knows his stuff, I see.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:05.740
A strategy based on having the higher ground, and an attack centered on team work...

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:07.990
The president is going all out.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:12.720
Takao..?

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:15.680
That idiot Max...

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.160
Let's go, Professor.

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:24.780
What a great team mate you are, Takao. This is the perfect timing for a pep talk.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.650
Max, what the heck are you doing?!

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.480
Takao..! Professor!

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:34.770
This is not like you at all!

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:35.650
What is..?

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:37.240
Hey, go back! You can't stay here!

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:38.840
I'm just talking with him!

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:39.500
Takao!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:45.080
I'm saying it's not like you to look away from the stadium and from Draciel in the middle of a battle!

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.300
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:50.090
Don't you feel bad for your poor Draciel?!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.860
Okay, okay. Let him go now.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:54.980
Did you hear that? Now let me go.

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:56.960
Takao!

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:59.560
That's a sad way of fighting!

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:03.350
You gotta look at Draciel more! You gotta fight together with him!

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:06.860
He's right, Max!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:11.280
Aren't you the one who always says "I want to have a good fight!"?

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.680
That's not a matter of winning or losing!

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:16.660
Isn't it a matter of <i>how</i> you fight?

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:18.490
Professor...

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:22.700
You have no reason to hesitate. Just fight with everything you've got!

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:25.400
Draciel...

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.440
I see... I'm sorry, Draciel.

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:34.910
I am fighting with you.

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:39.130
We should just fight the way we usually do.

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:45.020
Max! Show them your usual way of fighting!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:47.160
Show them the BBA spirit!

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:50.350
Okay, Takao, Professor!

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:58.040
Rei! Kai!

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:01.800
I am not alone. Let's go, Draciel

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:07.230
Whatever you plan to do, I am not going to help you.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:09.800
I don't mind help, just don't get in the way.

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:12.040
Okay. Come on, let's begin.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:14.760
Okay, we're at the final battle!

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:18.150
Three, Two, One!

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:20.660
Go... Shoot!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.360
The young girl didn't learn her lesson.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:32.570
This won't be a repeat of earlier!
I will take you down, one at a time!

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:34.850
All by yourself?

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.830
If you're going to get in my way, then...

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.840
Oh my, this is a problem!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:53.970
Go, go! Go-go, yahoo!

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:57.680
<i>Hi hi!</i>

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.650
Come on! Again like last time?!

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:10.100
Draciel!

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.370
I protect my comrades.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:21.650
My way of fighting is together with my comrades.

00:18:21.650 --> 00:18:21.660
Do whatever you want.
I will stick to my own principles.
My way of fighting is together with my comrades.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:25.560
Do whatever you want.
I will stick to my own principles.

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:33.210
There is a limit to what you can accomplish with your own strength, young lady.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:40.860
That's why I have become president. It's thanks to the support of millions of people.

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:44.250
Can you defeat our Revolving
Attack with your power alone?

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:01.360
Emily...

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:04.410
I told you, I will protect my comrades.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.160
Go, Draciel!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.670
Too late! This is the end!

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:23.570
This is <i>our</i> way of fighting!

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:43.700
We're not done here!

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:57.140
With this, I returned the favor.

00:19:57.900 --> 00:19:59.080
Thank you.

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:01.400
What a marvelous comeback!

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:08.360
This marks the end of a three-round fight so intense, nobody would believe it was a charity match!

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:13.100
Thank you for this very fulfilling battle.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:17.550
I feel bad for losing, but you've made me learn the depth of Beyblade.

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:21.560
I'm the one who should say thank you! It's been an honor to fight with you, Mr. President.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:39.540
Don't think your naive way of fighting will work at the world tournament!

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:47.800
You may be right. But I... No, <i>we</i> like this way of fighting the most.

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:09.860
You've gotten stronger, Max.

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:22.880
But the level of power you have now won't be enough against the world.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.290
Mama...

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.030 --> 00:23:02.410
According to my analysis, the American tournament has finally started.

00:23:02.410 --> 00:23:05.950
The first match will be against the powerful Mexican team.

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:09.040
Mariachi, matadors, even a gunman Blader!

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:13.480
And to top it off, the stadium is
a replica of the Grand Canyon! Amazing!

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:16.480
What?! Kai is going to fight?!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:19.960
Next time: The American Tournament Begins!

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:24.160
You can't do this, Kai!
The PPB is after your data!
